---
---

<section class="productos" id="productos">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="secnum" aria-hidden="true">05</span>
      <p class="lab">Productos destacados</p>
    </div>
    <div class="prod-head">
      <h2 class="display" data-reveal>La <em>colección.</em></h2>
      <p data-reveal>
        Tres piezas. Cero relleno. Cada una con su momento del día y su función clara.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid">
      <article class="card" data-tilt data-reveal>
        <div class="img">
          <img
            src="/images/mind-product.jpg"
            alt="Frascos de la línea Mind entre musgo y elementos naturales"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
        <p class="lab">MIND — 01</p>
        <h3 class="display">Enfoque</h3>
        <p class="desc">Lion's Mane. Tu primera hora manda: ritual matutino de precisión.</p>
        <span class="cta">Explorar →</span>
      </article>
      <article class="card featured" data-tilt data-reveal>
        <div class="img">
          <img
            src="/images/ref-10.jpg"
            alt="Colección de extractos botánicos sobre musgo"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
        <p class="lab">MIND — 02</p>
        <h3 class="display">Energía</h3>
        <p class="desc">Cordyceps. Entrena, crea, ejecuta: combustible diurno limpio.</p>
        <span class="cta">Explorar →</span>
      </article>
      <article class="card" data-tilt data-reveal>
        <div class="img">
          <img
            src="/images/producto-ritual.jpg"
            alt="Producto ritual rodeado de hongos y texturas orgánicas"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
        <p class="lab">GNOSIS — 01</p>
        <h3 class="display">Nocturna</h3>
        <p class="desc">Reishi. Cierra el día hacia adentro: ritual nocturno de descenso.</p>
        <span class="cta">Explorar →</span>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .productos {
    background: var(--void);
    padding: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 8.5rem) 0;
  }
  .sec-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .prod-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);
    margin: 0;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  h2 em {
    color: var(--ember);
  }
  .prod-head p {
    color: var(--muted-on-dark);
    max-width: 24rem;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
    perspective: 1200px;
  }
  .card {
    background: var(--ink);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--text-on-dark) 14%, transparent);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    padding-bottom: 1.75rem;
    will-change: transform;
    transition: border-color 200ms ease-out;
  }
  .card:hover {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ember) 60%, transparent);
  }
  .card .img {
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .card img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 380px;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 500ms ease-out;
  }
  .card:nth-child(1) img {
    object-position: center 35%;
  }
  .card:nth-child(2) img {
    object-position: center 60%;
  }
  .card:nth-child(3) img {
    object-position: center 30%;
  }
  .card:hover img {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }
  .card > *:not(.img) {
    padding-inline: 1.6rem;
  }
  .card .lab {
    padding-top: 1.4rem;
    color: var(--ember);
    opacity: 1;
  }
  .card h3 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .desc {
    color: var(--muted-on-dark);
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
  }
  .cta {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-on-dark);
  }
  .featured {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ember) 45%, transparent);
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .card img {
      height: 320px;
    }
  }
</style>
